{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoengine\/combatsystem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatSystem"},"abstract":[{"text":"A protocol defining turn-based combat behavior for enemies in the game.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CombatSystem"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/Combat"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Combat systems provide a sophisticated framework for implementing turn-based combat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encounters in interactive fiction games. Each enemy can have its own specialized","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"combat system, allowing for unique behaviors, special abilities, and varied difficulty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The combat system follows the Gnusto state change pipeline - all state modifications","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must flow through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ActionResult"},{"text":" objects to ensure proper game state management.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Turn-Based-Flow","text":"Turn-Based Flow","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each combat turn consists of:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Player action (attack, defend, talk, use item, etc.)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enemy reaction (counter-attack, taunt, flee, special ability, etc.)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolution of both actions with appropriate state changes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Enhanced-Combat-Events","text":"Enhanced Combat Events","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The system supports a full range of combat outcomes beyond simple hit\/miss:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Weapon Disarming"}]},{"text":": Combatants can lose their weapons during combat","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Staggering","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Attacks that cause temporary loss of balance and combat effectiveness"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Hesitation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Combat events that create openings for follow-up attacks","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Vulnerability","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Temporary states that make subsequent attacks more effective"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unconsciousness"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Non-lethal incapacitation of combatants","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fleeing & Surrender"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Intelligent enemies can retreat or give up when outmatched","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pacification"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Diplomatic resolution of combat through conversation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Usage","text":"Usage","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement this protocol to create custom combat behavior:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct DragonCombatSystem: CombatSystem {","    let enemyID: ItemID","","    func processCombatTurn(","        playerAction: PlayerAction,","        in context: ActionContext","    ) async -> ActionResult {","        \/\/ Custom dragon combat logic","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register combat systems with the game engine to override default behavior for specific enemies."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoEngine"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CombatSystem"}],"externalID":"s:12GnustoEngine12CombatSystemP","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CombatSystem"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","symbolKind":"protocol","title":"CombatSystem"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/StandardCombatSystem"],"title":"Conforming Types","kind":"relationships","type":"conformingTypes"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatSystem\/enemyID","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatSystem\/eventHandler"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatSystem\/calculateAttackOutcome(attacker:defender:weapon:in:)","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatSystem\/determineEnemyAction(against:enemy:in:)